  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/fc78bdbf-fff4-4dab-acf5-df57cdbfb200.png\" style=\"width:2.29375in;height:1.59375in\" /><br />Let diagonals <math><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></math> intersect at <math><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Area of quad&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>G</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />Now distance of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>–</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math> respectively.<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> <math><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> or <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Both are hyperbola with eccentricity <math><mo>=</mo></math> <math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;",
